<title>BULGARIA: Swiss Glencore wins Bulgarian 53,000 t wheat tender.</title>
<headline>Swiss Glencore wins Bulgarian 53,000 t wheat tender.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss firm Glencore won a third Bulgarian wheat import tender for 53,000 tonnes of bread wheat at $156.35 per tonne, deputy agriculture minister Valya Savcheva said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Glencore was awarded the contract to import 53,000 tonnes of wheat to Bulgaria, to be delivered by July 5,&quot; Savcheva told a news conference.</p>
</text>
